<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Thick Hide</ansi> mutation

Your skin thickens into a leathery integument, tough enough to turn
a blade. The cost is a certain gracelessness and an unsettling
appearance.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Substantial natural physical armor — your hide turns blows that
  would wound a normal person

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced dexterity — the stiff, leathery skin restricts
  fluid movement
  Moderately reduced charisma — the ridged hide is deeply unsettling
  in appearance

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Chameleon Skin

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
